[{"title":"冬景 炉存火似红","author":"刘辰翁","text":"向火火无功，炉中本不空。\n尤存尤自冷，似有似无红。\n围共香团兽，烧馀焰吐虹。\n寒威侵铄处，光气吐吞中。\n尚觉身成曲，惟应笑是烘。\n个中明点雪，万古不曾融。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10301,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 孤舟蓑笠翁","author":"刘辰翁","text":"泛泛水晶宫，孤舟凛欲东。\n短蓑并箬笠，举世一渔翁。\n大雪三千界，轻舠尺八空。\n无衣寒独速，皓首败天公。\n乘雁双凫外，斜风细雨中。\n羊裘差好事，聱钓不相同。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10302,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 独钓寒江雪","author":"刘辰翁","text":"一雪寒如此，何人立钓矼。\n不知身入画，独自影临江。\n未必鱼吞粒，惟应鹭作双。\n风吹沙皓皓，天阔水淙淙。\n归去村边路，看来缆失桩。\n夜深谁访旧，推月倚蓬窗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10303,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 深山催短景","author":"刘辰翁","text":"曝背无馀地，冬晴直万金。\n是谁催短景，政尔碍山深。\n鸟道空中小，猿啼底处寻。\n清霜经晓湿，红日半天沈。\n隐士三竿梦，宫人一线心。\n百年浑似此，何处惜光阴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10304,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 至后日初长","author":"刘辰翁","text":"至后晴堪定，阳来蔼未央。\n是虽年已晚，最喜日初长。\n自报黄钟动，谁将弱线量。\n荒寒无刻漏，宿昔已昏黄。\n天上开南陆，人间入寿乡。\n鲁阳惊昨梦，辛苦系扶桑。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10305,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 绣纹添弱线","author":"刘辰翁","text":"自取天章绣，深宫漏不闻。\n弱添今日线，閒认旧时纹。\n明丽千枝锦，蒙茸五色云。\n忽惊花样少，不为女工勤。\n缕结期千载，晴悭暖一分。\n隔窗谁似醉，睡冷篆炉薰。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10306,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 梅开不自觉","author":"刘辰翁","text":"度度看梅来，犹疑早计哉。\n相逢如有待，不自觉全开。\n每念苔枝雪，犹颁玉镜台。\n忽能同我笑，知复为谁催。\n有语为春误，何心待月来。\n老夫乘兴耳，不作剡溪回。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10307,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 疏影","author":"刘辰翁","text":"梅影明于画，空阶扫不除。\n自然清意别，比似众枝疏。\n明艳寒空里，孤梢落叶馀。\n溪横残雪久，日映碧窗虚。\n竹暗愁相并，花寒瘦亦如。\n临流羞白发，惟尔独华予。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10308,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 梅蕊惊眼","author":"刘辰翁","text":"又是梅新蕊，寒凋季子裘。\n抚时惊岁晚，满眼使人愁。\n江路春如许，阑干泪不收。\n别君从灞水，举目在扬州。\n月已成孤影，花应怪白头。\n数声羌笛弄，忍见坠珠楼。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10309,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 官梅动诗兴","author":"刘辰翁","text":"官路行人老，梅开客过时。\n徘徊深动兴，放浪自吟诗。\n水驿兼山驿，南枝更北枝。\n终然无一句，何以寄相思。\n岁月题梁在，风霜牧笛知。\n北人休系马，馀恨寄他谁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10310,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 聊寄一枝春","author":"刘辰翁","text":"故知花可惜，聊以赠相思。\n与子别多日，先春有一枝。\n荒凉逢雁过，辛苦折琼贻。\n北客遥簪雪，东风早驿诗。\n吾衰如雪白，到日是年时。\n若待青青子，寻芳计已迟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10311,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"冬景 汉节梅花外","author":"刘辰翁","text":"十九年辞汉，花如旧日开。\n自持天外节，谁寄陇头梅。\n死恨节旄尽，生知仗信来。\n春风横浦驿，夜雪满乡台。\n插鬓人空老，沈云雁未回。\n何因香入月，下照拂云堆。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10312,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"里门高","author":"刘辰翁","text":"里门高，里门坏，百年风雨何足怪。\n但怜谁受沐猴烹，子孙不见乌江败。\n人人知笑不知戒，春草茫茫雉争界。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10313,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"谢客起早自嘲","author":"刘辰翁","text":"笔起春如海，辞穷客到家。\n敲门嗔不应，只是隔梅花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10314,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"柳意","author":"刘辰翁","text":"独坐观柳色，一一如我须。\n一日一日深，一年一年枯。\n人言青胜我，安得白于吾。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10315,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"文文山画像赞","author":"刘辰翁","text":"闲居忽忽，万古咄咄。\n天风惨然，如动生发。\n如何寻约，亦念束刍。\n岂其英爽，犹累形躯。\n同时之人，能不颡泚。\n昔忌其生，今妒其死。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10316,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题永兴寺双罗汉树","author":"刘辰翁","text":"胜游重过日，双鬓已如秋。\n古树连云干，苍枝傍日浮。\n阴垂先代影，僧似六朝幽。\n翠藓横铺地，相贪竟日留。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10317,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"五君咏 阮籍","author":"钱选","text":"阮公虽沦迹，识密鉴亦洞。\n沉醉似埋照，寓辞类托讽。\n长啸若怀人，越礼自惊众。\n物故不可论，途穷能无恸。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10318,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"五君咏 嵇康","author":"钱选","text":"中散不偶世，本自餐霞人。\n形解验默仙，吐论知凝神。\n立俗迕流议，寻山洽隐沦。\n鸾翮有时锵，龙性谁能驯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10319,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"五君咏 向秀","author":"钱选","text":"向秀甘淡薄，深心托毫素。\n探道好渊玄，观书鄙章句。\n交吕既鸿轩，攀嵇亦凤举。\n流连河里游，恻怆山阳赋。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10320,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春景","author":"吕徽之","text":"脱溪冻解绿生波，好雨催花向晓过。\n宿酒未醒眠未起，半窗红日鸟声多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10321,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"丁督护曲 其二","author":"赵文","text":"丁督护，听我语。\n欲从君，臂不羽。\n嫁时所结发，剪之随君去。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10322,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"丁督护曲 其三","author":"赵文","text":"丁督护，念我苦。\n未亡人，殇鬼妇。\n古若无衔冤，乾坤无风雨。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10323,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"哭张文翁同舍 其二","author":"赵文","text":"扶上竹车去，知无再见期。\n谁能逃数定，不必恨归迟。\n白发扶棺母，青年上学儿。\n乱来朋友少，洒血一题诗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10324,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"挽蜀帅张公珏","author":"刘埙","text":"玉垒云浮五十秋，关西虓将勇无俦。\n三吴甑堕犹坚守，八柱唇亡不耐愁。\n泸水捷收劳騕袅，夔门机伏失兜鍪。\n吾君不负吾宁死，遗恨谁怜快敌雠。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10325,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"黄帝洞庭张乐图","author":"郑思肖","text":"天水相涵万象清，咸池真乐妙无根。\n大音岂在九霄外，有意听时却不闻。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10326,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"尧民击壤图","author":"郑思肖","text":"百姓相忘尧帝春，耕田凿井淡无情。\n只今正是何年月，日日月从东向生。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10327,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"许由弃瓢图","author":"郑思肖","text":"天下摇头不肯为，恰如瓢挂老松枝。\n许由不在箕山在，千古高风属阿谁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10328,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"吕望垂钓图","author":"郑思肖","text":"八十翁翁心尚孩，渭滨痴坐弄徘徊。\n当初若是逃名者，谁要文王上钓来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10329,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"夷齐西山图","author":"郑思肖","text":"扣马痴心谏不休，既拚一死百无忧。\n因何留得首阳在，只说商家不说周。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10330,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"老子度关图","author":"郑思肖","text":"紫气东来压万山，老聃吐舌笑开颜。\n青牛车外天风阔，摇动当年函谷关。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10331,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"纪昌贯虱悟射图","author":"郑思肖","text":"从来绝艺欲超伦，何止弯弓用意深。\n觑破微尘微极处，忽开大地见红心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10332,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"钟子期听琴图","author":"郑思肖","text":"一契高山流水心，形神空静两忘情。\n自非父母所生耳，听见伯牙声外声。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10333,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"荣启期三乐图","author":"郑思肖","text":"生死悠悠付老天，启期三乐亦超然。\n此身不得为男子，空活人间九十年。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10334,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"庄子梦蝶图","author":"郑思肖","text":"素来梦觉两俱空，开眼还如阖眼同。\n蝶是庄周周是蝶，百花无口骂春风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10335,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"轮扁谏读书图","author":"郑思肖","text":"轮扁释椎开口谏，国君据坐展书开。\n古人糟粕终枯淡，谁醉天然滋味来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10336,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"宁戚饭牛图","author":"郑思肖","text":"斯人岂是饭牛者，浩叹空怀扣角悲。\n说到漫漫长夜处，南山白石也攒眉。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10337,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孺子濯缨图","author":"郑思肖","text":"秋影澄澄湛碧波，濯缨人远意如何。\n临风歌罢飘然去，卖弄沧浪清处多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10338,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"叶公画龙图","author":"郑思肖","text":"神物难传变化时，叶公眼外泄天机。\n一从亲见真头角，满手风云雷电飞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10339,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟尝君度关图","author":"郑思肖","text":"狐白裘边事若难，孟尝门下亦何颜。\n若无意智翻身去，半夜焉能度此关。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10340,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"屈原九歌图","author":"郑思肖","text":"楚人念念爱清湘，苦忆九歌频断肠。\n只道此中皆楚国，还于何处拜东皇。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10341,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"屈原餐菊图","author":"郑思肖","text":"谁念三闾久陆沉，饱霜犹自傲秋深。\n年年吞吐说不得，一见黄花一苦心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10342,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"范蠡扁舟图","author":"郑思肖","text":"乌喙无情奈若何，功成只合理渔蓑。\n跃身吴越兴亡外，一舸江湖风月多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10343,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"毛遂脱颖图","author":"郑思肖","text":"十九人中不数君，当机勇辩独超群。\n若非末后脱颖出，多得英风泼楚云。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10344,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"鲁攲器图","author":"郑思肖","text":"此心安分即逍遥，无欲何愁外境摇。\n才有秋毫失中正，一杯水亦不能消。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10345,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"列子窃鈇图","author":"郑思肖","text":"宇宙茫茫尽坦途，莫将得失自相辜。\n胸中若有一些子，大地山河俱窃鈇。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10346,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋胡子图","author":"郑思肖","text":"郎归犹未到家中，艳语勾春妾面红。\n叵耐相逢不相识，梅花那肯恋东风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10347,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"西施捧心图","author":"郑思肖","text":"荡尽吴王醉后春，化为颦笑艳精神。\n当胸一点痛得别，直是妖娆恼杀人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10348,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"骊山老姥磨铁杵欲作绣针图","author":"郑思肖","text":"欲化龟蛇生圣胎，骊山微意孰能猜。\n纯钢一块都磨尽，不信纤毫眼不开。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10349,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秦女吹箫图","author":"郑思肖","text":"弄玉飘飘仙女姿，凤凰低舞久相期。\n箫中应有别一曲，飞出青天影外吹。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10350,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"湘灵鼓瑟图","author":"郑思肖","text":"雾质烟姿雪月心，凌波无迹似多情。\n试听谁在湘江上，彷佛秋风曲数声。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10351,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"毛女图","author":"郑思肖","text":"六国倾城辇入秦，深花密柳锁青春。\n神仙自有长生路，岂是阿房宫里人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10352,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"徐福采药图","author":"郑思肖","text":"仙药长生不易求，仙山可在海东头。\n祖龙灭尽诸侯后，徐福却来赢一筹。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10353,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"青门种瓜图","author":"郑思肖","text":"百二山河势莫当，咸阳谁付与高皇。\n尽嫌嬴政鲍鱼臭，争慕邵平瓜圃香。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10354,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"汉高祖将韩信图","author":"郑思肖","text":"先入关中得计多，彭城未是汉山河。\n不操擒纵英雄手，韩信何由肯倒戈。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10355,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"张子房遇黄石公图","author":"郑思肖","text":"三度桥边伺老仙，始将兵法尽相传。\n不知蹑足此一计，还出书中第几篇。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10356,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"四皓图","author":"郑思肖","text":"晔晔紫芝岩石隈，避秦有地似蓬莱。\n可怜白发坐不定，又被汉朝呼出来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10357,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"周亚夫细柳营图","author":"郑思肖","text":"细柳营中作略殊，宁容直入骤先驱。\n不因一见入门诀，文帝何曾识亚夫。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10358,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"李广射石虎图","author":"郑思肖","text":"怪石蹲身草芥中，错疑猛虎喷腥风。\n何消重费将军力，只在当头一箭功。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10359,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"董仲舒不窥园图","author":"郑思肖","text":"西汉诸儒君最醇，无人见面意应深。\n三年尽力窥经史，一旦看花了古今。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10360,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"苏武牧羊假寐图","author":"郑思肖","text":"十九年间堕渺茫，饥来齧雪齿生香。\n一心只梦飞归国，双眼何曾看见羊。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10361,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"苏李泣别图","author":"郑思肖","text":"同为武帝一时人，忠逆分违感慨深。\n早信子卿归汉去，泪痕滴滴滴黄金。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10362,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"司马相如题柱图","author":"郑思肖","text":"初上升仙何慷慨，重来衣锦颇从容。\n男儿意气当如此，透过禹门方是龙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10363,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"张骞乘槎图","author":"郑思肖","text":"牛女宫中事若何，亲身曾得上天河。\n逢人莫说支机石，漏泄苍苍意已多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10364,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"翟公交情图","author":"郑思肖","text":"翟公冷语久逾新，汉世交情古亦今。\n不被死生贫贱转，此时方始见人心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10365,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"朱买臣卖柴图","author":"郑思肖","text":"年当五十始荣华，覆水难收重叹嗟。\n岂信后来春色别，满柴担上尽开花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10366,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"二疏东门祖帐图","author":"郑思肖","text":"昔日贤哉二大夫，东门祖帐耀通衢。\n太平时节独先去，阖国人知此意无。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10367,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"严君平垂帘卖卜图","author":"郑思肖","text":"多是垂帘自养神，仅能了日即安贫。\n不离忠孝谈玄妙，岂是寻常卖卜人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10368,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"皇初平牧羊图","author":"郑思肖","text":"兄弟参商四十春，金华山里问斜曛。\n相逢不是牧羊客，白石颟顸冷笑君。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10369,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"西王母蟠桃宴图","author":"郑思肖","text":"玄圃筵开物外春，万仙欢笑动精神。\n蟠桃种子今犹在，谁是三千年后人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":10370,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]